                                        "entry_id": "fb929f21-0769-3f09-9c50-a86df2323b4b",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A country in the Donbas region, in eastern Ukraine. Seat: Luhansk; occupying 1/3 of the province, but claiming all the province, before the Russian invasion of all of Ukraine in 2022."
                                        ],
